One. A node ID is renamed in one edge only.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A["a"] --> B["b"]
    B --> C["c"]
```

Two. Two branch edges are swapped.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A -->|yes| B["b"]
    A -->|no| C["c"]
```

Three. The accDescr line is removed.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    accDescr: A short story
    A["a"] --> B["b"]
```

Four. A double quote is in a quoted label.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A["a"] --> B["b"]
```
